Subject: [PATCH 3/7] ub:ubctl:Support users to use query function in non root
 scenarios.

tool inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubctl/issues/28
CVE: NA

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

ubctl supports users to use query functions in non root scenarios,
but for configuration class functions, it will perform verification
interception

